lower Gaussian profile of `S²⁴` as its only hypothesis, and
`sphere24_gaussian_sharp_profile_lower` (`Riesz/LeechKernelBridge24.lean`) proves that profile
from the kernel inequalities of the Leech lattice.  Each statement below is the corresponding
statement with the hypothesis removed, proved by one application.

Contents: the sharp second-order asymptotics of the Riesz energy on `S²⁴` for `0 < s < 24` (with
the Epstein coefficient of the Leech lattice), for `-2 < s < 0`, the logarithmic energy, the
`L²` spherical cap discrepancy.  The limits of the actual extremal values are in
`Riesz/SphereOptimalMain24.lean`. -/

